                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Okay, so here goes: You my friend are completely missing the point of the Hunter's Life Canon Universe. It is an act that is completely predicated on a slow build-up of dick-numbing tension, brought to a filthy, sweaty climax of body-to-body brain-fucking.\nI'd like to talk a minute about the flow of this masterpiece. The entire game, from start to finish, is coy in nature. It puts you right there in the middle of it, begging for the protagonist to just. go. one. step. further.\nThe the next room cuts again to a side angle of a car sitting in a garage, straddling this poor sap, massive breasts and body making FULL CONTACT with our character as he is slowly fucked to death. Need I remind you that this shovel has the figure of a goddess?\nI'm not saying it's perfect. But from what you're telling me, you were expecting to wait less for the REAL drama. Patience is a virtue, and no life experience has taught me that more than watching this pornographic love-glazed adventure.\n\n6/10",
